            },
            {
              "en": "The bird used its bill to pick up food.",
              "zh": "那只鸟用嘴叼起食物。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
        "beak：也指鸟喙；bill 常用于鸭等嘴较扁的鸟。"
      ],
      "antonyms": [],
